---
source: crates/trawl-core/src/emitter/mod.rs
expression: "emit_dsl_err(r#\"* | where lower(level) == \"error\"\"#)"
---
unsupported operation: 'level' is a filter-only alias for the numeric severity column, not a stored column — it works in comparisons only (level=error, where level >= "warn"); to group, project or sort use severity (the number) or severity_text (the original text)
